    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Brand and identity designer, New York. Seniority: senior, Design Director-level. Former Design Director at COLLINS (Spotify, Twitch, Mailchimp identities), where she led the Girl Scouts of the USA rebrand over three years: visual identity, a custom typeface (Girl Scouts Serif), badge-inspired geometric system, apparel, product, art direction; ADC best-of-year in design. Now focused on Soon Foundation for the Arts (her current venture, shown on her site as On Soon / Erst) and teaches Design with Typography at SVA NYC. Autonomy 4 (estimate): led a multi-year flagship rebrand as Design Director and now runs her own venture; independent and directs work. Her personal site meganbowker.com is conceptual/editorial, so her identity work here is extracted from the COLLINS Girl Scouts case study (her flagship); her Instagram is mostly personal photography, not her brand work. Capability: Identity systems. LinkedIn megan-bowker-9b309789; Instagram @meganbowker; no public email found. Work Status: Studio/independent (Soon Foundation), ex-Collins. Jonathan notes she is former Collins; he does not know her personally, no rating yet.",
